Parts of reading_atlas/llm.py (API provider requests and the reading of keys saved by
koreader-reading-recap) are adapted from koreader-reading-recap, which uses the same licence.

Data and services used at run time, none of them bundled in this repository:
- Natural Earth land polygons (public domain), downloaded once on first use for the location map.
- OpenStreetMap data through the Nominatim geocoder (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL. Follow the Nominatim
  usage policy: identify yourself in "nominatim_contact", at most one request per second (results are cached).
- Wikimedia Commons maps, only if you place or search them; every file keeps its own licence, which the page shows.
- Your AI provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini) or the Codex CLI, under your own account and their terms.
